    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0005",
      "order": 5,
      "text": "dyscrasia, neuroleptic malignant syndrome or other disorder that increases the risk of \nserious side-effects (initiation with close monitoring in hospital may still be possible)\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.88909912109375,
        145.90948486328125,
        436.6390686035156,
        169.62948608398438
      ],
      "text_sha256": "c4259392541f250080362da93e3d351414054070b95785a9cadc70d6c70f84fa"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0006",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "■\n■Previous severe side effects on titration of clozapine or other antipsychotics\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        169.90948486328125,
        394.819091796875,
        181.62948608398438
      ],
      "text_sha256": "9f9901f0d28316a3930edc6817693a49d06d45710b5a7e678cf94ea36f0ce055"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0007",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "■\n■Unreliable or chaotic life-style that may affect adherence to the medication or the \n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        181.90948486328125,
        436.6289367675781,
        193.62948608398438
      ],
      "text_sha256": "86ee80715c4185bd0457906b245d7338ed4155a703debe9ade7436cbdb3accdd"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0008",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "monitoring regimen\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.88909912109375,
        193.90948486328125,
        156.43907165527344,
        205.62948608398438
      ],
      "text_sha256": "66953f4bf183a470faa0b804b07560474413f662a5e80403a881bb7b27e8bdd6"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0009",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "■\n■Significant abuse of alcohol or other drugs likely to increase the risk of side-effects \n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        205.90951538085938,
        436.6589660644531,
        217.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "9246c75e25bbf934e3869328d7090b635728aa2d3cdab01c5bcfa04d6f3273d1"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0010",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "(e.g. cocaine)\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.88909912109375,
        217.90951538085938,
        127.17909240722656,
        229.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "2c5bb8e40ae01b45404ecb3d9e47d9f28bd8dae6e99a6bf8d517b3fe5418dc7f"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0011",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "Suitability for community initiation (answers should all be yes)\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88909912109375,
        247.06451416015625,
        386.4552307128906,
        260.0995178222656
      ],
      "text_sha256": "ec40f8461a49135bc41fa09c0370924399bdbc1ac9e1a67d12189a898a61a48d"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0012",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "■\n■Is the patient likely to be adherent with oral medication and to monitoring \n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        271.9095153808594,
        436.6590270996094,
        283.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "4b49d379e0a5e875106994a211d055cc02513d0d5185ed813f40874a736fa3e4"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0013",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "requirements?\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.88909912109375,
        283.9095153808594,
        131.42909240722656,
        295.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "a1080757160bc759bdcd4cf740a5a421fc5a23687ca6b0e2c0e7b549d031c4f4"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0014",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "■\n■Has the patient understood the need for regular physical monitoring and blood tests?\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        295.9095153808594,
        433.87921142578125,
        307.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5706309fad2f7695da9d9a306d1ec03603e86482ae930066baea2991f6bd1ca7"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0015",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "■\n■Has the patient understood the possible side-effects and what to do about them (par-\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        307.9095153808594,
        433.8890686035156,
        319.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "2e064d82c4c3b772484efa9f4aaed3c1885bfe2d48c391930397051fc233d3ef"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0016",
      "order": 16,
      "text": "ticularly the rare but serious ones)?\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.88911437988281,
        319.9095153808594,
        222.5791015625,
        331.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "ce2fe671138a283fb15b65d214db40c1f1f3e9522885a3fce3c82b5cabff35c9"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0017",
      "order": 17,
      "text": "■\n■Is the patient readily contactable (e.g. in the event of a result that needs follow-up)?\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        331.9095153808594,
        430.53900146484375,
        343.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "233beaccbcd13ff42a96c3561d15897d467c3c5f65e26ec600925fa76a264b9d"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0018",
      "order": 18,
      "text": "■\n■Is it possible for the patient to be seen every day during the early titration phase?\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        343.9095153808594,
        419.26910400390625,
        355.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "85f60b716e66f49d2f372dcd6d5e9f0db714e8f5d2f01f29d14b6a035d8cef13"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0019",
      "order": 19,
      "text": "■\n■Is the patient able to collect medication every week or can medication be delivered to \n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        355.9095153808594,
        436.6890563964844,
        367.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "6928e4174c8763c4aafa6c47cb0eafe2f11dae0bca08113ed461e2df31981d14"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0020",
      "order": 20,
      "text": "their home?\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.88909912109375,
        367.9095153808594,
        121.98908996582031,
        379.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "3ff0df4885bb50601f038ca095ca57ec242bca17ea624f18fe7019fdfcf1bd85"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0021",
      "order": 21,
      "text": "■\n■Is the patient likely to be able to seek help out-of-hours if they experience potentially \n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        379.9095153808594,
        436.6090393066406,
        391.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "72884d058492ff3d414ae0131fa9fa7925d1d8ba4ed0a0dc61de734b41f94761"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0022",
      "order": 22,
      "text": "serious side-effects (e.g. indicators of myocarditis or infection such as fever, malaise, \nchest pain)?\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.88909912109375,
        391.9095153808594,
        436.6591491699219,
        415.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "118e637c8e208119aa73d72831ed2ad1cd9100cf67b393716000552daf497377"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0023",
      "order": 23,
      "text": "Initial work-up\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88909912109375,
        433.06451416015625,
        138.29507446289062,
        446.0995178222656
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e198b3f4dc084e6b40ce9737c019470416f0177301f3f5faf601cfb79e728806"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0024",
      "order": 24,
      "text": "To screen for risk factors and provide a baseline:\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88909912109375,
        451.9095153808594,
        271.5090637207031,
        463.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "917612f7a69a9d637519a6d1d6ed45e140214d0497261c37f77bb85405daec0a"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0025",
      "order": 25,
      "text": "■\n■Physical examination, FBC (see below), LFTs, urea and electrolytes (U&Es), lipids, \n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        469.9095153808594,
        436.6291809082031,
        481.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "4d653e6a7425ce4451b209b933c7dc6caba62d1f9bd31951c3397e5beeb6df0f"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0026",
      "order": 26,
      "text": "glucose/HbA1c. Consider troponin, C-reactive protein (CRP), beta-natriuretic pep-\ntide, erythrocyte sedimentation rate (ESR) (as baseline for further tests)\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.88909912109375,
        481.9095153808594,
        433.8990783691406,
        505.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e61f51c67cba41a4350f88ea912ff9d57be6108644726efa584308329cdb8d53"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0027",
      "order": 27,
      "text": "■\n■ECG- particularly to screen for evidence of past MI or ventricular abnormality\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        505.90948486328125,
        409.79913330078125,
        517.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "56b555b51dba12513906aff96d3061d2127428b9ac8cb054d13e179f153ba4ea"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0028",
      "order": 28,
      "text": "■\n■Echocardiogram if clinically indicated\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        517.9094848632812,
        234.2390899658203,
        529.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "8419a6c879f606521dce321f94ca59e9effb5da270f6e347729f6d915e3a34bb"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0029",
      "order": 29,
      "text": "Mandatory blood monitoring and registration\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88909912109375,
        547.0645141601562,
        299.445068359375,
        560.0994873046875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "6a009a099e19fab41767fa9481d73a0619ff5b1819aa192fda1e634580f04b38"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0030",
      "order": 30,
      "text": "■\n■Register with the relevant monitoring service.\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        571.9094848632812,
        266.9991149902344,
        583.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "9c8985c3c45c69e34b6ffde4e294414e472010198a14d3595dbd2719e3b9eb86"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0031",
      "order": 31,
      "text": "■\n■Perform baseline blood tests (white cell count (WCC) and differential count) before \n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        583.9094848632812,
        436.6590270996094,
        595.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "930b10b64e5ae99e39c5f11948a48927595dd9d3c368f6927b0be44022b18eb4"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0032",
      "order": 32,
      "text": "starting clozapine.\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.88909912109375,
        595.9094848632812,
        149.78909301757812,
        607.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "42546310fbeb20a4141fdb0538447098de45afdd2ddc555eed8e79a74d630bbd"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0033",
      "order": 33,
      "text": "■\n■Further blood testing continues weekly for the first 18 weeks and then every 2 weeks \n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        607.9094848632812,
        436.6490173339844,
        619.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "2c692f01b24dd35fc61d29d1912d5a9a443b8740f8c9ab29e96628eec1696971"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0034",
      "order": 34,
      "text": "for the remainder of the year. After that, the blood monitoring is usually done monthly.\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.88909912109375,
        619.9094848632812,
        434.2289733886719,
        631.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "ac9aceac74bd2e04f392a85968e6c8aeb1a9e67bb2f5c1d320f64b2f3ede8bbe"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0229-block-0035",
      "order": 35,
      "text": "■\n■Inform the patient’s GP.\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.888999938964844,
        631.9094848632812,
        173.29908752441406,
        643.6295166015625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d39adc85ef50f2a783679f9554276ff6c67f8efcc9e4a47139e81990ea3f1148"
    }
